@startuml ssd-us085
skinparam actorStyle awesome

title US085 – Test/validate a flight plan (System Sequence Diagram)

actor Pilot
participant ":AISafe System" as System

activate Pilot

Pilot -> System : requestTestFlightPlan(route, departureDate)
activate System
System --> Pilot : show the flight's current (VALIDATED) plan
deactivate System

Pilot -> System : confirmTest()
activate System
note right of System
  Re-validate DSL (US120) → resolve attached weather (US082)
  → run §3.3 fuel/altitude physics → check departure consistency
end note
alt plan passes the test
    System --> Pilot : verdict OK – plan promoted to TESTED
else plan fails the test
    System --> Pilot : verdict FAILED – clear reasons\n(DSL issues / fuel / altitude / departure);\nstate unchanged
end
deactivate System

@enduml